{"page":540,"verses":[{"verse_key":"57:19","surah":57,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ وَرُسُلِهِۦٓ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلصِّدِّيقُونَ ۖ وَٱلشُّهَدَآءُ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ لَهُمْ أَجْرُهُمْ وَنُورُهُمْ ۖ وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَكَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْجَحِيمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who believe in God and His messengers are the truthful ones who will bear witness before their Lord: they will have their reward and their light. But those who disbelieve and deny Our revelations are the inhabitants of Hell.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"57:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"57:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"57:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَرُسُلِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"and His Messengers","transliteration":"warusulihi","verse_key":"57:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"[those]","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"57:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"57:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلصِّدِّيقُونَ ۖ","en_gloss":"(are) the truthful","transliteration":"l-ṣidīqūna","verse_key":"57:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلشُّهَدَآءُ","en_gloss":"and the martyrs","transliteration":"wal-shuhadāu","verse_key":"57:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"(are) with","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"57:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"57:19"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"For them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"57:19"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَجْرُهُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) their reward","transliteration":"ajruhum","verse_key":"57:19"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَنُورُهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"and their light","transliteration":"wanūruhum","verse_key":"57:19"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"But those who","transliteration":"wa-al