 the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَعِبٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) play","transliteration":"laʿibun","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَهْوٌۭ","en_gloss":"and amusement","transliteration":"walahwun","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَزِينَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"and adornment","transliteration":"wazīnatun","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَتَفَاخُرٌۢ","en_gloss":"and boasting","transliteration":"watafākhurun","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَيْنَكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"baynakum","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَتَكَاثُرٌۭ","en_gloss":"and competition in increase","transliteration":"watakāthurun","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْوَٰلِ","en_gloss":"the wealth","transliteration":"l-amwāli","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَٱلْأَوْلَـٰدِ ۖ","en_gloss":"and the children","transliteration":"wal-awlādi","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَمَثَلِ","en_gloss":"like (the) example","transliteration":"kamathali","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":15,"ar":"غَيْثٍ","en_gloss":"(of) a rain","transliteration":"ghaythin","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَعْجَبَ","en_gloss":"pleases","transliteration":"aʿjaba","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْكُفَّارَ","en_gloss":"the tillers","transliteration":"l-kufāra","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":18,"ar":"نَبَاتُهُۥ","en_gloss":"its growth","transliteration":"nabātuhu","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":20,"ar":"يَهِيجُ","en_gloss":"it dries","transliteration":"yahīju","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":21,"ar":"فَتَرَىٰهُ","en_gloss":"and you see it","transliteration":"fatarāhu","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":22,"ar":"مُصْفَرًّۭا","en_gloss":"turning yellow","transliteration":"muṣ'farran","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":23,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":24,"ar":"يَكُونُ","en_gloss":"becomes","transliteration":"yakūnu","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":25,"ar":"حُطَـٰمًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"debris","transliteration":"ḥuṭāman","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَفِى","en_gloss":"And in","transliteration":"wafī","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":28,"ar":"عَذَابٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":29,"ar":"شَدِيدٌۭ","en_gloss":"severe","transliteration":"shadīdun","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":30,"ar":"وَمَغْفِرَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"and forgiveness","transliteration":"wamaghfiratun","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":31,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":32,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":33,"ar":"وَرِضْوَٰنٌۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"and Pleasure","transliteration":"wariḍ'wānun","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":34,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"But not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":35,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","en_gloss":"(is) the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayatu","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":36,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَآ","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":37,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":38,"ar":"مَتَـٰعُ","en_gloss":"(the) enjoyment","transliteration":"matāʿu","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":39,"ar":"ٱلْغُرُورِ","en_gloss":"(of) delusion","transliteration":"l-ghurūri","verse_key":"57:20"},{"pos":40,"ar":"٢٠","en_gloss":"(20)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"57:20"}]},{"verse_key":"57:21","surah":57,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"سَابِقُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰ مَغْفِرَةٍ مِّن رَّبِّكُمْ وَجَنَّةٍ عَرْضُهَا كَعَرْضِ ٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ أُعِدَّتْ لِلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ وَرُسُلِهِۦ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ فَضْلُ ٱللَّهِ يُؤْتِيهِ مَن يَشَآءُ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ ذُو ٱلْفَضْلِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So race for your Lord’s forgiveness and a Garden as wide as the heavens and earth, prepared for those who believe in God and His messengers: that is God’s bounty, which He bestows on whoever He pleases. God’s bounty is infinite.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"سَابِقُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"Race","transliteration":"sābiqū","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَغْفِرَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"(the) forgiveness","transliteration":"maghfiratin","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَّبِّكُمْ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbikum","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَجَنَّةٍ","en_gloss":"and a Garden","transliteration":"wajannatin","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَرْضُهَا","en_gloss":"its width","transliteration":"ʿarḍuhā","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَعَرْضِ","en_gloss":"(is) like (the) width","transliteration":"kaʿarḍi","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heaven","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أُعِدَّتْ","en_gloss":"prepared","transliteration":"uʿiddat","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"for those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَرُسُلِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"and His Messengers","transliteration":"warusulihi","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فَضْلُ","en_gloss":"(is the) Bounty","transliteration":"faḍlu","verse_key":"57:21"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","